    "detailed_description": "Drift Experience Japan is a small, experience oriented game.<br>Experience modern Assets developed by gifted creators using the unreal Engine 5.<br>Drift Experience Japan: Supporter Edition gives you extra content to your game and a Bonus Mode.<br>Experience the roads around Haruna, Hakone, Gunma, a garage, a practice- and a race track.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracks</h2>Choose between the tracks and select day and at night settings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322410/extras/953c466317f12560941e5c9c413a97ec.avif?t=1738360031\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drift</h2>The car has an challenging arcade drift handling and can be controlled by keyboard or gamepad.<br>It may take some to time to get used to it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322410/extras/0311d685f8927ec7a51ce5b3fdac5cfc.avif?t=1738360031\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2>Fully customize your car. Change tires, different body parts, paint.<br>Customization is available in Gunma, Haruna, garage and on practice track. Use a prebuild setup in Hakone and on the race track with modified setups!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322410/extras/73f642a78425046a4255cda846894560.avif?t=1738360031\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonus</h2>Bonus RC Stunt Mode: Try to collect all stars!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322410/extras/1ea85e3190028ba05cf47f4e65d68cbe.avif?t=1738360031\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 circuits<br></li><li>day / night settings for 4 circuits<br></li><li>car customizing in 3 circuits (Haruna, Gunma, Practice)<br></li><li>challenging arcade drift physics <br></li><li>RC Bonus</li></ul>",
